      'The Carrier undertakes to deliver the cargo entrusted to it by the Customer (laboratory and medical goods) to the destination and hand it over to the authorised consignee; the Customer pays for the carriage. The Civil Code of the RK (chapter “Carriage”) and the RK Law “On Road Transport” apply.',
